  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Jagadeesan vs State Represented By Its on 10 December, 2024 Author: N.Anand Venkatesh Bench: N.Anand Venkatesh Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 10.12.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice N.Anand Venkatesh Crl.O.P(MD)No.6440 of 2022 and Crl.M.P(MD)No.4461 of 2022 1. Jagadeesan 2 . As Safa Aqua Industries, Represented by its Managing Partner, Jagadeesan, No.20, Manathattai Agraharam, Manathattai, Kulithalai, Karur District. ... Petit Vs State represented by its Food Safety Officer, Code No.430, Kulithalai Town, Kulithalai Union, Karur. ... Respon Prayer: Criminal Original petitions have been filed under Sections (1) (b) of the Code of Criminal Procedure , call for the entire reco to the proceeding in STC.No.86/2022 on the file of the learned Judi Magistrate No.II, Kulithalai and quash the same as illegal. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis",
    "facts": "This petition has been filed challenging the proceedings in S.T.C.No.86 of 2022, on the file of the learned Judicial Magistrate No.II, Kulithalai, for the offence under Section 59(i) of Food safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
